#: ../../language/error_codes/E4216.md:1
msgid "E4216"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4216.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `lexscan_catchall_binder_not_supported`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`lexscan_catchall_binder_not_supported`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4216.md:5
msgid "A `lexscan` catch-all case uses a binder pattern."
msgstr "`lexscan` 的兜底分支使用了绑定模式。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4216.md:7
msgid ""
"`lexscan` consumes input only when a regex matches. The final catch-all "
"also handles end of input, so it does not bind a matched substring. Use "
"`_` for that case and bind text with `as` on the regex cases that need "
"it. This also applies when the target is an in-memory "
"`@lexbuf.StringScanner`."
msgstr ""
"`lexscan` 只在正则匹配时消费输入。最后的兜底分支还负责处理输入结束，因此不会绑定匹配到的子串。该分支应使用 `_`，需要匹配文本的正则分支则通过 "
"`as` 绑定。当目标是内存中的 `@lexbuf.StringScanner` 时，这一规则同样适用。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4216.md:12
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4216.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn next_token(lexbuf : @lexbuf.Lexbuf) -> String {\n"
"  lexscan lexbuf {\n"
"    (re\"^[a-z]+\" as word) => word.to_owned()\n"
"    rest => rest.to_owned()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4216.md:18
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4216.md:20
msgid "Replace the catch-all binder with `_`."
msgstr "将兜底分支的绑定变量替换为 `_`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4216.md:22
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn next_token(lexbuf : @lexbuf.Lexbuf) -> String {\n"
"  lexscan lexbuf {\n"
"    (re\"^[a-z]+\" as word) => word.to_owned()\n"
"    _ => \"end\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
